  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Northern Province Cooperative &amp; Marketing Union Livestock Feed Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Location: Kasama, Northern Province, Zambia.Summary: This project will scale up the production of livestock feed by upgrading existing machinery at the feeding plant to include purchase of a boiler, extruder, and an oil expeller machine. The grant will also be used to provide working capital to purchase raw materials for livestock feed production.</narrative>
  </description>
